2Ki 18:1 , Hezekiah's good reign;
2Ki 18:4 , He destroys idolatry, and prospers;
2Ki 18:9 , The inhabitants of Samaria are carried captive for their sins;
2Ki 18:13 , Sennacherib invading Judah, is pacified by a tribute;
2Ki 18:17 , Rab-shakeh, by blasphemous persuasions, solicits the people to revolt.
